[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Copy %%ETCDIR%%/tuwunel.toml.sample to %%ETCDIR%%/tuwunel.toml and set at
least server_name before starting the service.  The database is kept in
/var/db/tuwunel.

Tuwunel speaks plain HTTP and expects a reverse proxy in front of it for
TLS and for serving the .well-known delegation of your domain.

The database pool scales with the number of CPU cores and can exceed the
default kern.threads.max_threads_per_proc of 1500 on larger hosts, which
keeps the server from starting.  Lower max_workers under
[global.database.pool] or raise that limit.

On ZFS, set allow_fallocate = false under [global.rocksdb].
EOM
}
]
